Subscription:
1. the user can unlock all features only through a paid subscription, including unlimited access to the query moon phase information feature, and also the calendar, temperature and humidity, enjoying iterative updates and a clean and ad-free interface;
2. the subscription fee will be deducted from the user's iTunes account upon confirmation of purchase, with a free three-day trial and automatic renewal at $29.99/year;
3. users can turn off auto-renewal 24 hours before the end of the current subscription, otherwise the subscription will automatically renew;
4. the Apple ID of the automatically renewed subscription will be automatically deducted from the iTunes account 24 hours before the expiration of each billing cycle and the corresponding validity period will be extended;
5. Users manage the subscription service, i.e., they can go to their user accounts to set off automatic subscriptions after purchase.

